PINNs - weights
■ If only boundary points are selected for the data points, the weights should be one. wdata = wPDE = 1. This follow froms the point collocation method, see slide XYZ.
■ If the data points include points inside the domain as well, then the value of weights should be adjusted. For Nu ≪ Nc,
